 "set": "keep-series-grouping",
 "description": "`| keep` leaves only the labels it names (PR for semantics/keep-leaves-labels-loki-drops): a JSON or logfmt key named like a stream label is name_extracted and is gone after `| keep name`, and the streams that keep the same labels are one series. K1 and K2 are log queries (a json and a logfmt key colliding with the level stream label), K3 counts the series over a keep of a key no line has (Loki 1, one series per stream before), K4 is its instant form, K5 a rate over a keep of a stream label, K6 a count grouped by a kept key that a JSON key collides with. The metric shapes are grouped by the kept labels in VictoriaLogs' stats. Run with the control set.",
